        <briefdescription>
<para>Compare batch embedding generation with sequential generation. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Helper method for OCP-IT-09 and OCP-IT-10. Verifies that generating N images in a batch produces identical results to generating them sequentially with N separate calls.</para>
